                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The whole inverse world concept is neat, but your character controls like a tank and enemies are far more annoying then fun to fight.\n\nYou can't control you jump height (tapping or holding jump makes no difference), you have exactly one speed for moving left/right (no analog movement or walk/run toggle), there are no movement based abilities (dash/roll/slide/etc.), and no defensive abilities. Also, many enemies get huge invincibility windows after each hit but don't stagger back (just pause for half a second), and come at you in huge numbers.\n\nDon't waste your time on this, there are far too many better games you could be playing.",
